rows.en:
In an instant, the air in the room went tight as a wire.
Every eye turned to the door at once.
As we stared at it, it came again...{p}

I waited for Iwashita to take her seat, then approached the door.
Timidly, I reached out and gripped the knob tight.
Then I slowly turned it...{p}

...Click.
With a small sound, the door opened.
"Who is it...?"{p}

"If you feel that strongly, I guess it can't be helped.
All right.
Please do as you like, Iwashita."{p}

"Thank you, I will."
Iwashita went to the door, took one deep breath, then reached for the knob.
But a split second before her hand touched it, the doorknob turned with a click.{p}

"Yuya was here!
He finally came back to me, and...
Because you had to be so spiteful, {a}...{p}
